WEBVTT

01:18.520 --> 01:21.780
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.880 --> 01:24.760
[Episode 29]

01:27.030 --> 01:28.410
Did you find the medicine?

01:28.410 --> 01:29.630
I'm dying of pain.

01:42.520 --> 01:43.320
What's wrong?

01:45.650 --> 01:46.710
What are you doing?

01:48.020 --> 01:49.250
Whose hair is this?

01:49.780 --> 01:50.640
What hair?

01:51.310 --> 01:52.770
Come and see for yourself.

02:05.090 --> 02:06.350
Isn't this your hair?

02:06.750 --> 02:07.880
This hair

02:07.900 --> 02:08.880
is completely different from mine.

02:08.880 --> 02:11.000
The length, thickness, texture, and color

02:11.000 --> 02:12.060
are all different.

02:12.070 --> 02:12.880
I see.

02:13.440 --> 02:14.790
This must be Jinzi's hair.

02:14.790 --> 02:15.720
So the slippers at the door

02:15.720 --> 02:16.460
are also Jinzi's.

02:16.460 --> 02:18.510
And the daisies were brought by Jinzi too?

02:18.510 --> 02:19.400
Are you a forensic examiner

02:19.400 --> 02:20.470
or a cop?

02:22.140 --> 02:23.190
I bought the daisies.

02:23.190 --> 02:24.300
Qiqi was wearing the slippers.

02:24.300 --> 02:25.579
Jinzi really was here?

02:27.710 --> 02:28.470
It's fine.

02:28.470 --> 02:29.720
Why did you lie to me?

02:31.470 --> 02:32.240
I didn't lie.

02:32.470 --> 02:34.880
We... we're not in the kind
of relationship you think we are.

02:34.880 --> 02:36.050
I had no choice that day.

02:36.050 --> 02:36.930
You don't need to explain.

02:36.930 --> 02:37.700
Bandage it yourself.

02:37.700 --> 02:38.190
Wait. What?

02:38.190 --> 02:39.450
Are... are you not going to eat?

02:39.450 --> 02:40.130
I'm not.

02:50.940 --> 02:53.300
That's how it happened.

02:54.120 --> 02:55.590
It was really not what you think.

02:55.590 --> 02:57.280
I was just doing a favor.

02:58.900 --> 02:59.880
So the one I should be thanking

02:59.880 --> 03:01.430
for that pot of porridge
and the new set of tableware

03:01.430 --> 03:03.400
is actually Jinzi?

03:03.480 --> 03:04.590
Thank her?

03:04.960 --> 03:06.890
I really can't explain this to you.

03:07.410 --> 03:08.180
Qian Fei.

03:09.000 --> 03:09.750
Are you...

03:09.770 --> 03:11.480
Are you jealous?

03:12.310 --> 03:12.960
I...

03:13.560 --> 03:14.840
We're not a couple.

03:14.860 --> 03:16.120
Why would I be jealous?

03:16.590 --> 03:17.700
We are landlord and tenant,

03:17.700 --> 03:19.760
mentor and apprentice, and friends.

03:19.880 --> 03:21.030
Why would I be jealous?

03:21.030 --> 03:21.910
If you're not jealous,

03:21.910 --> 03:24.320
why are you overreacting?

03:25.870 --> 03:27.000
We've been living together

03:27.000 --> 03:28.600
for quite a while.

03:28.630 --> 03:30.760
Why can't we be honest with each other?

03:31.510 --> 03:33.440
I already said
I'd make things convenient for you,

03:33.440 --> 03:34.970
so don't lie to me.

03:35.000 --> 03:36.260
You are always full of nonsense.

03:36.260 --> 03:36.960
I have no idea

03:36.960 --> 03:37.790
which things you say are true

03:37.790 --> 03:38.910
and which aren't.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.310
First,

03:40.440 --> 03:42.000
Jinzi is really not my girlfriend.

03:42.000 --> 03:42.910
We don't have

03:42.910 --> 03:44.560
the kind of relationship you think we do.

03:44.560 --> 03:45.400
Second,

03:45.910 --> 03:47.370
if I really wanted to hide it from you,

03:47.370 --> 03:48.510
a careful person like me

03:48.510 --> 03:49.510
would definitely have cleaned

03:49.510 --> 03:50.800
the marks off the sofa.

03:50.820 --> 03:51.960
Would I let you find out?

03:51.960 --> 03:53.550
Stop explaining to me!

03:53.790 --> 03:54.840
Fine. I won't explain.

03:54.840 --> 03:55.960
I was wrong, okay?

03:56.000 --> 03:56.770
I apologize.

03:56.880 --> 03:57.860
I was wrong, okay?

03:57.860 --> 03:58.790
Come out now.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.680
Don't stay in there.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.400
My...

04:00.680 --> 04:01.850
My hand hurts.

04:02.130 --> 04:02.960
If you don't come out,

04:02.960 --> 04:04.690
I'm going to call an ambulance.

04:04.880 --> 04:07.050
You can apply the medicine yourself.
It doesn't need to be bandaged.

04:07.050 --> 04:07.920
With such a big wound,

04:07.920 --> 04:09.080
how could I not bandage it?

04:09.080 --> 04:10.240
This is very serious.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.480
The skin is broken.

04:11.510 --> 04:12.710
The skin is broken.

04:15.190 --> 04:16.390
Take a look. Help me.

04:16.390 --> 04:16.880
Hurry.

04:17.810 --> 04:18.940
You're so stupid.

04:23.900 --> 04:24.830
Help me. Help me.

04:25.560 --> 04:26.440
Help me.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.780
Please help me.

04:29.150 --> 04:29.760
It hurts.

04:29.910 --> 04:30.900
So stupid.

04:31.510 --> 04:32.100
I know.

04:32.120 --> 04:33.050
Please, help me.

05:07.610 --> 05:08.710
You're not mad anymore, right?

05:08.710 --> 05:09.730
I didn't say that.

05:10.450 --> 05:12.380
That means you're not mad anymore.

05:21.970 --> 05:22.620
It hurts.

05:23.790 --> 05:25.200
Blow on it.

05:29.440 --> 05:30.370
To ease the pain.

05:31.550 --> 05:32.190
Bah!

05:32.220 --> 05:33.240
That's fine too.

05:39.550 --> 05:40.480
Don't be mad.

05:40.920 --> 05:41.940
Let's go eat.

05:44.040 --> 05:44.710
Okay?

05:45.810 --> 05:47.540
I already admitted my mistake.

06:00.490 --> 06:01.350
Have a taste.

06:01.720 --> 06:03.190
Try this salad.

06:03.320 --> 06:04.460
I made it myself.

06:10.710 --> 06:11.480
Qian Fei, you're here?

06:11.480 --> 06:12.040
Morning.

06:13.440 --> 06:14.500
Morning, Qian Fei.

06:14.680 --> 06:15.210
Morning.

06:15.210 --> 06:16.530
You're here, Qian Fei?

06:15.330 --> 06:21.780
[Office Area]

06:17.190 --> 06:17.880
Dai Xi.

06:17.880 --> 06:18.800
Morning, Mr. Cui.

06:18.800 --> 06:19.710
Happy New Year.

06:20.800 --> 06:21.680
Qian Fei.

06:21.850 --> 06:25.320
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]
[Director's Office]

06:21.980 --> 06:24.190
Look at you. It's only been a week,

06:24.240 --> 06:26.490
and you're getting prettier and prettier.

06:26.490 --> 06:28.640
Tell me, are you seeing someone?

06:28.710 --> 06:30.710
Why are you so gossipy?

06:31.190 --> 06:33.120
Don't you know
being back home does wonders?

06:33.120 --> 06:34.440
So that's how it is.

06:36.740 --> 06:39.260
The first cup of coffee this spring—
it's yours.

06:39.250 --> 06:44.600
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]
[Director's Office]

06:47.600 --> 06:48.540
Who is this?

06:48.800 --> 06:50.060
You've never seen him?

06:50.890 --> 06:53.159
The new CFO at Shanlifang.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.920
Your ex-boyfriend...

06:55.680 --> 06:57.740
You don't mind me saying that, do you?

06:57.880 --> 06:58.740
What about him?

06:59.520 --> 07:02.040
That Wang Ruohai—he resigned.

07:03.810 --> 07:05.890
I was wondering back then.

07:06.480 --> 07:07.270
What did a

07:07.270 --> 07:09.240
billionaire heiress

07:09.480 --> 07:10.810
see in him?

07:10.920 --> 07:11.750
I couldn't figure it out.

07:11.750 --> 07:13.280
As expected, they broke up.

07:13.960 --> 07:14.820
Think about it.

07:15.390 --> 07:16.800
If two people break up,

07:17.150 --> 07:18.530
how can they still work together?

07:18.530 --> 07:19.000
Right?

07:22.130 --> 07:23.330
You are an exception.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.810
An absolute exception.

07:25.140 --> 07:27.070
That's because I don't care at all.

07:29.880 --> 07:30.810
This is a good thing.

07:30.810 --> 07:32.340
From now on, no one will dare

07:32.390 --> 07:34.409
stand in our Qian Fei's way.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.650
Now all I want to do is focus on work

07:36.650 --> 07:39.180
and keep moving forward
without hesitation.

07:42.659 --> 07:44.490
-I'll go and brief the staff.
-Wash the cup when you're done.

07:42.770 --> 07:48.930
[Office Area]

07:44.730 --> 07:45.590
Director Fang.

07:47.710 --> 07:49.880
I need to work with Shanlifang Hotel Group

07:49.880 --> 07:51.080
on an investigation.

07:51.150 --> 07:52.020
The follow-up work

07:52.020 --> 07:54.820
will be arranged
by Mr. Li of Zhizhong Investment.

07:55.310 --> 07:57.240
Just do your respective jobs well.

07:58.280 --> 08:01.640
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]
[Director's Office]

07:59.000 --> 08:00.860
-Director Fang.
-Director Fang.

08:01.740 --> 08:03.820
[Office Area]

08:13.390 --> 08:14.110
Yifei,

08:14.850 --> 08:15.780
we used to be

08:15.810 --> 08:17.580
a couple.

08:17.920 --> 08:18.510
Do you really have

08:18.510 --> 08:19.910
no feelings for me at all?

08:20.510 --> 08:21.570
I don't believe it.

08:22.670 --> 08:25.510
And I certainly don't believe
you could like your landlady.

08:25.510 --> 08:26.200
You did that back then

08:26.200 --> 08:27.260
just to make me mad.

08:27.280 --> 08:29.360
That was why you did it on purpose, right?

08:29.360 --> 08:30.030
Or else,

08:30.060 --> 08:32.059
you're using her as my replacement.

08:32.630 --> 08:35.030
I don't believe you're that cold-hearted.

08:35.320 --> 08:35.840
How...

08:36.720 --> 08:38.100
How did getting married

08:38.150 --> 08:39.780
make you so brain-dead?

08:41.080 --> 08:42.150
You might as well be like you were before,

08:42.150 --> 08:44.480
talking to me openly
about money and benefits.

08:44.480 --> 08:46.630
Why are you acting so fake?

08:48.200 --> 08:49.430
Well...

08:50.240 --> 08:51.440
now that I'm married,

08:51.910 --> 08:53.770
I've gotten what I wanted before,

08:54.200 --> 08:54.800
and Niu...

08:55.930 --> 08:58.220
Niu has been treating me well too,

08:59.000 --> 09:01.190
but I always feel like
I have nothing to do.

09:01.190 --> 09:02.670
I want to realize my value.

09:02.670 --> 09:03.670
I really want...

09:03.790 --> 09:05.920
I really want to do something on my own.

09:06.240 --> 09:08.070
So, Yifei, please help me.

09:08.670 --> 09:09.430
Besides you,

09:09.430 --> 09:10.390
I really can't think

09:10.390 --> 09:11.730
of anyone else who can help me.

09:11.730 --> 09:12.930
Then you really got the wrong person.

09:12.930 --> 09:14.260
I really can't help you.

09:14.290 --> 09:15.510
Even Niu can't help you.

09:15.510 --> 09:16.600
How can I help you?

09:16.960 --> 09:17.840
And besides,

09:17.840 --> 09:18.720
I can't imagine

09:18.720 --> 09:19.880
that in this project,

09:19.880 --> 09:21.410
what value you can realize.

09:22.390 --> 09:24.720
Li Yifei, you're being a little mean here.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.200
I am...

09:27.870 --> 09:30.950
really not doing well right now.

09:31.390 --> 09:33.240
Whether you are doing well or not,

09:33.240 --> 09:35.170
or whether your marriage is happy,

09:35.240 --> 09:37.500
has nothing to do with me anymore, right?

09:37.750 --> 09:38.630
I...

09:40.000 --> 09:40.960
can't help you.

09:42.220 --> 09:45.390
You should seek help from someone else.

09:45.780 --> 09:47.310
Don't waste your time on me.

09:47.940 --> 09:48.460
Okay.

09:50.200 --> 09:50.790
Li Yifei,

09:51.710 --> 09:53.370
just pretend I was never here.

10:02.430 --> 10:03.920
Alright, come out.

10:04.570 --> 10:06.830
Watching a show without buying a ticket?

10:07.850 --> 10:09.450
Do you want to see the sequel?

10:15.320 --> 10:16.150
Um...

10:16.870 --> 10:18.060
Are you okay?

10:19.330 --> 10:20.860
What could be wrong with me?

10:22.490 --> 10:24.820
Why did she suddenly come looking for you?

10:25.110 --> 10:26.710
Didn't you hear everything?

10:28.600 --> 10:30.370
Looks like an ex-boyfriend

10:30.390 --> 10:32.390
is the cure for a troubled marriage.

10:37.900 --> 10:40.160
What are you thinking about?

10:40.600 --> 10:42.200
What could I be thinking about?

10:42.200 --> 10:43.290
Is there anything wrong

10:43.290 --> 10:44.400
with what I said just now?

10:44.400 --> 10:45.600
No, nothing's wrong.

10:46.610 --> 10:47.490
Then tell me.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.580
Why were you following me?

10:49.830 --> 10:51.160
Why would I follow you?

10:51.180 --> 10:52.520
I'm no one to you.

10:54.550 --> 10:55.950
Since you are no one to me,

10:55.960 --> 10:57.490
why did you still follow me?

10:59.360 --> 11:00.390
Director Fang

11:00.490 --> 11:01.960
was taken away by people from Shanlifang.

11:01.960 --> 11:02.960
Do you know why?

11:05.030 --> 11:06.410
Have you forgotten about the incident

11:06.410 --> 11:08.170
in the hotel room at Shanlifang
before New Year?

11:08.170 --> 11:09.300
Of course I haven't.

11:09.360 --> 11:10.560
It's because of that.

11:11.660 --> 11:14.120
What does that have to do
with Director Fang?

11:19.120 --> 11:20.030
What?

11:22.780 --> 11:23.630
A mole?

11:23.750 --> 11:24.600
I didn't say that.

11:24.600 --> 11:26.730
How can you say Director Fang is a mole?

11:26.940 --> 11:27.850
Really?

11:28.000 --> 11:29.200
It's absolutely impossible.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.600
Director Fang has no motive

11:30.600 --> 11:32.050
and no reason to do this.

11:32.270 --> 11:33.720
What kind of person Fang Yun is,

11:33.720 --> 11:35.120
I know better than you do.

11:35.720 --> 11:37.320
Do you think everyone is like you?

11:37.320 --> 11:38.840
Have a little compassion.

11:39.120 --> 11:40.000
Alright.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.640
Whether she did it or not,

11:42.000 --> 11:43.230
she's been taken away.

11:43.230 --> 11:44.200
But the people who took her

11:44.200 --> 11:45.800
are from within Shanlifang.

11:46.360 --> 11:48.720
And the economic investigation department
hasn't intervened.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.550
This means that

11:50.570 --> 11:52.500
even if Shanlifang investigates,

11:52.750 --> 11:55.440
they might not necessarily
hold her accountable.

11:55.440 --> 11:56.170
Understand?

11:57.430 --> 11:58.030
So,

11:58.970 --> 12:00.900
why exactly were you following me?

12:01.550 --> 12:02.840
Crazy.

12:04.150 --> 12:05.950
Is it that hard to tell the truth?

12:11.950 --> 12:13.280
Why are you back so late?

12:13.720 --> 12:15.250
I went to get my phone fixed.

12:16.040 --> 12:16.740
What?

12:17.910 --> 12:19.170
Your phone was broken?

12:19.610 --> 12:22.000
Do you have to gloat like that?

12:22.130 --> 12:23.780
My phone caught some virus

12:23.800 --> 12:25.200
and turned into a brick.

12:25.490 --> 12:27.150
I guess it can't be fixed then.

12:27.940 --> 12:29.600
Are you sure it can't be fixed?

12:59.580 --> 13:00.700
Suddenly I realized

13:00.700 --> 13:03.560
that these past few days,
Li Yifei has actually been

13:03.600 --> 13:04.910
voluntarily helping me do the dishes

13:04.910 --> 13:06.510
without me even noticing it.

13:23.030 --> 13:23.660
Wow.

13:24.750 --> 13:26.570
Is this your new phone?

13:26.590 --> 13:27.930
Then how about lending me

13:27.930 --> 13:28.740
your old one?

13:31.200 --> 13:32.200
Forget it then.

13:32.320 --> 13:33.390
I'll ask Jingjing.

13:33.800 --> 13:35.400
Are you stupid or what?

13:36.400 --> 13:37.460
This is for you.

13:39.000 --> 13:39.510
This...

13:42.090 --> 13:43.170
This is for me?

13:46.400 --> 13:46.860
This...

13:47.420 --> 13:49.600
This is the latest model, right?

13:49.600 --> 13:50.390
It must cost 5 figures.

13:50.390 --> 13:51.790
Such an expensive phone?

13:53.840 --> 13:55.040
You aren't trying...

13:55.390 --> 13:58.680
to use this
to cover next month's rent, are you?

13:58.760 --> 13:59.620
Let me tell you,

13:59.750 --> 14:01.010
that's not happening.

14:01.550 --> 14:02.390
I don't accept

14:02.470 --> 14:03.530
anything but cash.

14:04.600 --> 14:06.430
Stop being so petty.

14:07.330 --> 14:08.990
When have I ever skipped rent?

14:09.720 --> 14:11.340
I just noticed your phone was too old.

14:11.340 --> 14:12.700
It took half a minute to open an app,

14:12.700 --> 14:13.680
and you always take forever
to reply to messages.

14:13.680 --> 14:15.600
So I thought
I'd get you a new one to play with.

14:15.600 --> 14:16.240
It just so happens

14:16.240 --> 14:17.810
that your phone actually broke.

14:17.810 --> 14:18.940
What a coincidence.

14:19.020 --> 14:19.930
Play with?

14:20.500 --> 14:20.960
You...

14:21.670 --> 14:22.930
This is too expensive.

14:22.960 --> 14:25.690
Even if you want to give it to me,
I can't accept it.

14:26.200 --> 14:27.080
So you really don't want it?

14:27.080 --> 14:27.910
I want it!

14:27.910 --> 14:29.020
I really do!

14:29.120 --> 14:30.720
But... but it's really too expensive.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.480
I definitely can't just accept

14:32.480 --> 14:33.610
a gift for no reason.

14:33.750 --> 14:34.480
I've realized

14:34.480 --> 14:35.980
that you are both honest and stupid.

14:35.980 --> 14:38.000
This is just a refurbished phone
from my friend.

14:38.000 --> 14:39.510
It only cost 2,700.

14:39.910 --> 14:41.170
How is that expensive?

14:41.390 --> 14:42.510
It's not expensive at all, okay?

14:42.510 --> 14:45.710
It's not even as expensive as
a fancy meal I'd treat you to.

14:45.960 --> 14:47.560
You can accept it now, right?

14:48.460 --> 14:50.720
Then I still have to transfer you
the 2,700.

14:50.720 --> 14:51.930
If you don't take the money,

14:51.930 --> 14:53.230
I won't accept this phone.

14:53.230 --> 14:54.400
I can't believe it.

15:20.970 --> 15:21.730
Listen!

15:22.220 --> 15:24.080
Let's find
a quieter place next time, shall we?

15:24.080 --> 15:24.830
I can't even hear you clearly

15:24.830 --> 15:25.880
or see anything.

15:26.080 --> 15:27.680
Didn't you use to love

15:27.710 --> 15:29.480
the loud beats?

15:29.510 --> 15:31.770
I don't like it anymore!

15:31.910 --> 15:32.390
Now I...

15:32.390 --> 15:34.370
Now you just like your landlady!

15:34.390 --> 15:35.800
Don't even mention it.

15:36.100 --> 15:38.650
A few days ago,
you asked me to get 2 phones.

15:38.670 --> 15:39.990
I thought you were going to
give them to Jinzi.

15:39.990 --> 15:41.710
Did you give them to your landlady?

15:41.710 --> 15:43.120
I did. So what?

15:43.840 --> 15:44.200
Fine.

15:44.240 --> 15:45.910
I guess my good intentions
were wasted on you.

15:45.910 --> 15:46.390
Alright?

15:46.390 --> 15:47.170
I'm not getting involved

15:47.170 --> 15:48.630
in your business anymore.

15:48.960 --> 15:50.460
[Why don't you accept it?]

15:49.040 --> 15:50.270
Accept the money.

15:50.360 --> 15:51.430
For such an expensive phone,

15:50.490 --> 15:53.520
[Accept the money. For such an
expensive phone, I have to pay you.]

15:51.430 --> 15:52.480
I have to pay you.

15:52.910 --> 15:53.480
Come on.

15:53.550 --> 15:55.610
[Do we really have to be so clear-cut?]

16:04.270 --> 16:06.270
Do we really have to be so clear-cut?

16:10.600 --> 16:11.600
Of course.

16:11.720 --> 16:13.750
I know accepting favors
can make you feel indebted.

16:13.750 --> 16:14.550
Just accept it.

16:14.550 --> 16:16.620
Otherwise, I'll give the phone back to you
when you get back.

16:16.420 --> 16:20.220
[Qian Fei]

16:20.370 --> 16:20.840
[Please Wait]

16:20.890 --> 16:22.340
You've been staring at your phone
all night.

16:20.950 --> 16:21.100
[Accepted]

16:22.380 --> 16:23.470
Are you drinking or not?

16:23.470 --> 16:23.750
[Please Wait]

16:23.780 --> 16:24.340
[Payment received.
Funds have been added to your Balance.]

16:27.030 --> 16:28.630
This phone works really well.

16:27.070 --> 16:28.690
[This phone works well. I'll make
stir-fried eggplant strips for you tonight.]

16:29.510 --> 16:31.170
Stir-fried eggplant strips?

16:32.270 --> 16:33.170
She got you

16:33.400 --> 16:35.200
to fall in love with her
just by doing this?

16:35.200 --> 16:36.290
You know nothing!

16:37.850 --> 16:39.240
Now I see.

16:39.600 --> 16:41.390
You've fallen for her!

16:45.580 --> 16:45.960
Right!

16:45.960 --> 16:47.140
I can't keep falling here.

16:47.140 --> 16:48.170
I have to go now!

16:48.750 --> 16:49.670
Bro!

16:49.860 --> 16:50.880
There's still
more than half a bottle left.

16:50.880 --> 16:51.910
I opened it especially for you!

16:51.910 --> 16:52.800
Drink it!

16:52.820 --> 16:54.040
Drink it with the girls!

16:54.040 --> 16:54.520
You...

16:54.540 --> 16:55.300
I'm leaving.

16:57.470 --> 16:58.110
Yifei!

16:58.130 --> 16:59.120
Where are you going?

16:59.120 --> 17:00.320
Leave him be.

17:00.350 --> 17:00.910
Look at him.

17:00.910 --> 17:01.800
Let's drink.

17:02.050 --> 17:03.300
Let's drink.

17:07.319 --> 17:07.990
Take care.

17:18.220 --> 17:19.020
32.5.

17:20.490 --> 17:21.290
Okay.

17:22.430 --> 17:23.040
Thank you.

17:24.280 --> 17:25.390
Take care.

17:43.620 --> 17:44.480
Director Fang?

17:45.090 --> 17:46.050
Director Fang?

17:46.520 --> 17:47.730
Director Fang.

17:50.810 --> 17:52.270
Director Fang is okay now?

17:52.430 --> 17:53.760
The mole is someone else.

17:53.760 --> 17:56.560
It's been confirmed
that it wasn't Director Fang.

18:06.260 --> 18:07.090
Miss Qian.

18:08.080 --> 18:09.130
Hello, Mr. Wu.

18:09.910 --> 18:12.140
The Weibo account "Back-office Dumbo"

18:12.320 --> 18:13.250
is yours, right?

18:14.210 --> 18:15.560
Yes, why?

18:15.990 --> 18:17.910
We've contacted the Weibo account

18:17.910 --> 18:19.860
"0.33" that leaked
Shanlifang's information.

18:19.860 --> 18:21.280
According to him,

18:21.610 --> 18:23.000
his source of information

18:23.000 --> 18:24.360
was exactly the Weibo account

18:24.360 --> 18:25.790
"Back-office Dumbo".

18:27.390 --> 18:28.880
Come on. How is that possible?

18:28.880 --> 18:30.050
I don't even know him,

18:30.050 --> 18:32.250
and I haven't used Weibo for a long time.

18:32.400 --> 18:33.660
Open it and take a look.

18:33.920 --> 18:34.970
Then we'll know the truth, won't we?

18:34.970 --> 18:35.580
Sure.

18:42.240 --> 18:43.330
[Incorrect ID or password.
Please log in again.]

18:53.520 --> 18:54.320
What's wrong?

18:55.630 --> 18:57.360
The password seems to be wrong.

19:01.490 --> 19:02.420
What's going on?

19:03.780 --> 19:05.110
You can't log in, right?

19:07.080 --> 19:08.140
It doesn't matter.

19:08.360 --> 19:09.920
This is our IT specialist.

19:10.020 --> 19:12.020
If you want to prove your innocence,

19:12.190 --> 19:13.650
please cooperate with our investigation.

19:13.650 --> 19:14.270
Also,

19:14.290 --> 19:15.570
hand over your phone.

19:15.840 --> 19:16.900
We need to check it.

19:17.230 --> 19:17.800
Sure.

19:19.870 --> 19:21.590
But I just got this phone
the day before yesterday.

19:21.590 --> 19:22.790
You can have this one.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.460
What about your old phone?

19:25.880 --> 19:26.470
It got a virus.

19:26.470 --> 19:27.710
So I sold it.

19:27.740 --> 19:29.140
Right at a time like this?

19:29.630 --> 19:30.910
Perfect timing.

19:30.990 --> 19:32.850
Wait. What do you mean, Mr. Wu?

19:32.940 --> 19:34.170
Do you think I'm connected

19:34.170 --> 19:35.010
to 0.33?

19:35.470 --> 19:36.330
How about this?

19:36.410 --> 19:37.520
You can call

19:37.520 --> 19:38.760
this 0.33 over.

19:38.780 --> 19:40.340
I can confront them face to face.

19:40.340 --> 19:41.130
I am sorry.

19:41.600 --> 19:43.950
It's not convenient for 0.33
to appear in person.

19:43.950 --> 19:44.470
Well...

19:46.610 --> 19:48.390
Take her office supplies away.

19:48.950 --> 19:50.010
What are you doing?

19:50.320 --> 19:51.860
We need to take them back for inspection.

19:51.860 --> 19:52.880
It wasn't me.

19:52.910 --> 19:53.520
Miss Qian,

19:54.120 --> 19:56.320
please leave Shanlifang immediately.

19:58.200 --> 20:00.060
It wasn't me. It really wasn't me.

20:01.940 --> 20:03.600
Come on. How can you do this?

20:04.710 --> 20:05.630
Mr. Li.

20:12.990 --> 20:13.540
Boss.

20:13.670 --> 20:14.800
What are you doing here

20:14.800 --> 20:16.190
instead of being at your desk?

20:16.190 --> 20:17.800
Boss, you're finally back.

20:17.820 --> 20:19.110
They insisted
that Qian Fei's Weibo account

20:19.110 --> 20:20.170
is related to 0.33,

20:20.180 --> 20:21.940
and they want to investigate her.

20:21.940 --> 20:22.940
Where is Qian Fei?

20:23.560 --> 20:24.340
Her desk was cleared.

20:24.340 --> 20:25.400
She must have left.

20:27.760 --> 20:29.010
I'll go find Fang Yun.

20:29.030 --> 20:29.840
Boss.

20:30.210 --> 20:32.140
You won't find out anything if you go now,

20:32.140 --> 20:33.950
and you might get yourself in trouble.

20:33.950 --> 20:34.880
Why don't you

20:34.940 --> 20:37.140
wait until you get home and ask Qian Fei?

20:45.830 --> 20:46.640
I'm back.

20:57.090 --> 20:57.940
I'm back.

21:09.290 --> 21:10.520
I'm back, Landlady!

21:18.270 --> 21:19.070
Are you there?

21:23.800 --> 21:24.600
I talked to...

21:27.120 --> 21:27.850
Where is she?

22:07.710 --> 22:08.430
Sorry.

22:09.600 --> 22:11.060
I couldn't help you today.

22:13.350 --> 22:14.560
In that situation,

22:14.590 --> 22:16.150
you couldn't really argue.

22:18.150 --> 22:18.880
Let's drink.

22:23.470 --> 22:23.930
Come on.

22:24.070 --> 22:25.070
Cheers.

22:25.480 --> 22:26.840
You're actually drinking?

22:26.840 --> 22:28.070
Shouldn't you try

22:28.100 --> 22:29.700
to log into your Weibo again?

22:32.810 --> 22:35.340
I can't log into Weibo.

22:35.710 --> 22:38.510
I kept trying on my phone

22:38.560 --> 22:39.540
for a long time.

22:39.880 --> 22:41.830
It kept saying wrong password

22:41.990 --> 22:42.790
or something.

22:42.840 --> 22:43.760
Whatever.

22:46.390 --> 22:48.350
I've worked so hard all these years

22:49.760 --> 22:51.580
only to end up like this.

22:54.420 --> 22:55.440
But it's fine.

22:56.480 --> 22:59.540
I don't have to participate
in this deception anymore.

23:02.520 --> 23:03.670
Deception?

23:09.150 --> 23:10.680
Did you find something out?

23:18.470 --> 23:19.730
It was Fang Yun, right?

23:22.670 --> 23:24.120
When she was taken away,

23:25.730 --> 23:27.260
I felt something was wrong.

23:27.290 --> 23:28.620
If it were someone else,

23:28.780 --> 23:29.880
then why would she be

23:29.880 --> 23:31.280
the first one taken away?

23:31.590 --> 23:32.760
Just because she's

23:32.790 --> 23:33.850
a department head?

23:38.880 --> 23:39.960
And today,

23:40.520 --> 23:42.780
Shanlifang was pointing fingers at you.

23:43.410 --> 23:44.390
Why didn't she stand up

23:44.390 --> 23:45.590
and say a word for you?

23:48.430 --> 23:50.110
He Jing has already fired me.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.480
It was Fang Yun who fired you.

23:53.840 --> 23:55.050
So I think you

23:55.070 --> 23:57.270
should really clear things up with her.

23:59.540 --> 24:01.400
The financial world is small.

24:02.190 --> 24:02.990
If this continues,

24:02.990 --> 24:04.390
you'll be blacklisted.

24:05.210 --> 24:06.410
When that happens,

24:09.370 --> 24:10.230
your career

24:10.230 --> 24:11.360
will really be over.

24:12.040 --> 24:13.010
Qian Fei.

24:17.010 --> 24:18.330
You're such a competitive person.

24:18.330 --> 24:18.930
Why are you

24:19.190 --> 24:20.560
letting them

24:20.580 --> 24:21.710
wrong you like this?

24:26.630 --> 24:27.320
I'm...

24:30.670 --> 24:32.520
not sad because they

24:32.520 --> 24:33.560
wronged me.

24:36.360 --> 24:39.280
I'm completely disappointed
in this industry,

24:39.280 --> 24:40.080
you know?

24:41.370 --> 24:42.940
Disappointed.

24:44.540 --> 24:46.010
Then what do you want to do?

24:48.280 --> 24:49.780
I don't want to talk about work anymore.

24:49.780 --> 24:50.980
Let's drink. Come on.

24:51.320 --> 24:51.840
Come on.

24:51.860 --> 24:52.780
Stop drinking, Qian Fei.

24:52.780 --> 24:55.730
Come on! Just have a drink with me!

25:18.320 --> 25:19.190
Stop drinking.

25:19.790 --> 25:21.270
Come on, cheers.

25:23.410 --> 25:24.940
No more talking about work.

25:51.530 --> 25:54.480
I'm still so sad.

25:55.190 --> 25:55.800
You,

25:56.080 --> 25:57.940
go inside and get me some alcohol.

25:58.670 --> 26:00.120
You'll only feel worse if you drink more.

26:00.120 --> 26:00.990
Stop drinking.

26:01.010 --> 26:01.760
No!

26:02.320 --> 26:03.180
Go get it for me!

26:03.670 --> 26:04.540
I won't get it for you!

26:04.540 --> 26:06.600
-Didn't you say you would help me?
-But I won't...

26:06.600 --> 26:08.330
Stop drinking. Stop drinking.

26:08.350 --> 26:09.680
Rock, paper, scissors!

26:09.820 --> 26:11.650
Rock, paper, scissors!

26:27.510 --> 26:31.710
♪ No need to guess the ending
right from the beginning ♪

26:34.340 --> 26:39.650
♪ Let the melody play
among the chords and the wind ♪

26:42.330 --> 26:47.910
♪ And no need to demand
that yesterday keeps its promises ♪

26:49.100 --> 26:54.600
♪ Leave some surprises in life
to the unknown ♪

26:57.510 --> 27:02.670
♪ There's no need to make a judgment
based on a few past ♪

27:03.550 --> 27:09.210
♪ Somehow I feel a little disappointed
That's why I create poems ♪

27:12.340 --> 27:17.840
♪ There's no need
to give up for the past ♪

27:18.730 --> 27:24.250
♪ I need some courage to get praises ♪

27:24.000 --> 27:25.980
I'm so sad.

27:25.090 --> 27:28.050
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

27:26.940 --> 27:28.460
I know you are sad.

27:28.780 --> 27:31.890
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

27:29.230 --> 27:31.300
No, you don't.

27:31.590 --> 27:32.650
I will help you.

27:32.960 --> 27:39.070
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

27:33.650 --> 27:35.570
I'm so sad.

27:35.600 --> 27:36.260
Go to sleep.

27:36.630 --> 27:38.500
-Go to sleep now. Alright.
-I'm so sad.

27:38.500 --> 27:40.430
-Alright, alright.
-Stay with me.

27:40.550 --> 27:42.840
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

27:43.870 --> 27:46.810
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

27:47.880 --> 27:49.500
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

27:50.330 --> 27:53.070
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

28:06.040 --> 28:08.390
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

28:09.310 --> 28:12.560
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

28:13.830 --> 28:19.850
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

28:21.130 --> 28:23.050
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

28:23.970 --> 28:27.370
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

28:29.050 --> 28:31.310
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

28:33.030 --> 28:40.060
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

28:40.120 --> 28:41.550
No, I'm sorry.

28:43.150 --> 28:44.810
I can't take advantage of you.

28:48.500 --> 28:49.540
But Qian Fei,

28:53.410 --> 28:54.490
I really like you.

29:01.470 --> 29:02.400
You fell asleep?

29:06.320 --> 29:07.360
What do you mean?

29:12.840 --> 29:13.330
Wake up!

29:13.360 --> 29:13.900
Tell me!

29:13.930 --> 29:14.860
What do you mean?

29:17.910 --> 29:18.780
Tell me what you mean!

29:18.780 --> 29:19.520
Wake up!

29:21.370 --> 29:21.940
Tell me!

29:21.970 --> 29:23.430
What do you mean, Qian Fei?

29:26.120 --> 29:26.840
Wake up!

29:28.040 --> 29:29.660
Explain it to me!

29:30.630 --> 29:32.090
What did you mean just now?

29:32.560 --> 29:34.020
How could you fall asleep?

29:34.910 --> 29:35.930
What are you doing?
Are you going to throw up?

29:35.930 --> 29:36.750
Wait, wait, wait!

29:36.750 --> 29:37.750
Hold on, hold on, hold on!

29:37.750 --> 29:38.560
I'll go get...

29:43.810 --> 29:45.470
You dislike me that much, huh?

29:49.380 --> 29:50.950
You don't want to throw up now?

29:50.950 --> 29:51.680
Are you okay?

30:01.370 --> 30:01.840
Hello?

30:03.730 --> 30:06.390
She drank too much earlier
and is already in bed.

30:07.150 --> 30:07.670
Me?

30:08.600 --> 30:09.880
What's wrong with me?

30:11.670 --> 30:12.500
I'm fine.

30:12.520 --> 30:14.050
Okay, I'll take care of her.

30:14.670 --> 30:15.560
Okay.

30:40.340 --> 30:41.670
I'll put the water here.

30:43.760 --> 30:45.620
Cover yourself with the blanket.

31:25.310 --> 31:26.090
It will pass.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.010
[Yu]

32:05.490 --> 32:06.640
Hello, Yu.

32:07.230 --> 32:09.360
Hey, are you awake?

32:09.780 --> 32:10.650
Not yet.

32:11.190 --> 32:12.460
I bought you breakfast.

32:12.460 --> 32:13.880
I'll be right downstairs.

32:13.880 --> 32:15.390
Come down and get it in a bit.

32:15.390 --> 32:17.320
Aren't you coming up to eat with me?

32:18.030 --> 32:19.690
I'm eating while I'm on my way.

32:19.960 --> 32:21.110
The office will be busy this afternoon.

32:21.110 --> 32:22.230
I even took the afternoon off

32:22.230 --> 32:24.560
to participate in the dance competition.

32:25.040 --> 32:26.770
Can you handle being this busy?

32:27.850 --> 32:29.070
Don't worry about me.

32:29.540 --> 32:31.190
Jingjing and I already discussed it.

32:31.190 --> 32:32.140
As for your situation,

32:32.140 --> 32:33.480
even though we can't resolve it right now,

32:33.480 --> 32:35.470
we still need to contain the rumors.

32:35.470 --> 32:36.770
I need to get to the office early.

32:36.770 --> 32:37.660
If anyone runs their mouth,

32:37.660 --> 32:39.460
I'll teach them a lesson for you.

32:39.590 --> 32:40.440
My dear Yu.

32:40.460 --> 32:41.920
Don't just worry about me.

32:42.280 --> 32:44.760
Remember to eat your meals on time.

32:44.780 --> 32:46.310
Take good care of yourself.

32:46.520 --> 32:47.640
Don't worry.

32:48.950 --> 32:50.060
It's a bit chilly today.

32:50.060 --> 32:52.790
Remember to dress warmly
when you go downstairs.

32:53.960 --> 32:54.930
You know what?

32:54.950 --> 32:57.070
I think I had a dream last night.

32:59.360 --> 33:00.070
How should I put it?

33:00.070 --> 33:00.600
It was...

33:01.950 --> 33:02.520
very...

33:02.800 --> 33:03.990
very exciting.

33:07.520 --> 33:08.180
Exciting?

33:08.800 --> 33:10.060
What kind of exciting?

33:12.910 --> 33:13.630
Well...

33:16.420 --> 33:17.850
Well, I dreamed that...

33:19.670 --> 33:22.520
a guy kissed me.

33:23.210 --> 33:25.840
And... he was very gentle.

33:28.150 --> 33:28.840
Who was it?

33:30.360 --> 33:31.000
And then?

33:32.520 --> 33:34.880
Then we kissed for a while,
and that was it.

33:36.700 --> 33:37.910
That was boring.

33:40.190 --> 33:41.120
Why do I feel like

33:41.340 --> 33:43.670
you dreamed about what you really wanted?

33:43.800 --> 33:45.800
Do you remember what he looked like?

33:47.080 --> 33:48.020
Very handsome.

33:48.430 --> 33:50.360
Honestly, he was really handsome.

33:50.950 --> 33:52.950
More handsome than any guy I know.

33:54.840 --> 33:56.570
What about compared to Li Yifei?

33:56.570 --> 33:58.770
Of course he was more handsome than him.

33:59.120 --> 34:00.450
More handsome than him?

34:00.640 --> 34:02.250
Why do I feel like it was him?

34:02.430 --> 34:03.590
When I called you yesterday,

34:03.590 --> 34:04.920
he was right next to you.

34:06.020 --> 34:07.110
He was...

34:07.950 --> 34:09.110
Why was he next to me?

34:10.159 --> 34:10.800
He said

34:11.389 --> 34:12.790
he was getting you water.

34:14.469 --> 34:16.000
Did you two yesterday...

34:18.150 --> 34:20.000
Im—Impossible.

34:20.760 --> 34:21.350
That...

34:21.840 --> 34:22.300
Then...

34:22.320 --> 34:22.860
He...

34:22.889 --> 34:25.020
Wouldn't he be taking advantage of me?

34:25.280 --> 34:26.900
He wouldn't do something like that.

34:26.900 --> 34:27.960
It couldn't be him.

34:29.429 --> 34:30.989
You're defending him?

34:31.150 --> 34:32.389
Okay, I'm almost there.

34:32.389 --> 34:33.800
Get ready and come downstairs.

34:33.800 --> 34:34.830
Okay, okay.

34:34.860 --> 34:36.210
I'll go down now.

34:43.889 --> 34:44.929
You startled me.

34:45.260 --> 34:46.590
What are you doing here?

34:47.690 --> 34:50.570
Well, I just made you some porridge.

34:52.690 --> 34:54.090
You made porridge for me?

34:54.350 --> 34:55.750
Are you really that kind?

34:56.159 --> 34:58.290
I just learned how to make it. Try some.

34:58.930 --> 35:00.790
Have you been here the whole time?

35:02.310 --> 35:03.500
I was making a phone call inside.

35:03.500 --> 35:04.900
Did you hear everything?

35:06.590 --> 35:07.680
I... I heard...

35:08.550 --> 35:09.510
a little bit.

35:09.720 --> 35:10.900
You heard a little bit?

35:10.900 --> 35:11.860
I'm warning you.

35:11.880 --> 35:13.280
Everything you just heard,

35:13.280 --> 35:14.640
pretend you didn't hear it.

35:14.640 --> 35:16.370
Never mention it in the future.

35:18.280 --> 35:18.880
I...

35:21.840 --> 35:25.040
Alright, just leave it there.
I'll have it when I get back.

35:25.630 --> 35:27.970
If you bought it, it's fine.
Why say you made it?

35:27.970 --> 35:29.310
I really made it myself.

35:29.470 --> 35:30.470
Yeah, right.

35:46.470 --> 35:48.800
She actually thought all that was a dream?

35:50.840 --> 35:52.900
Or did I really take advantage of her?

35:54.280 --> 35:55.740
I won't think about it for now.

35:55.740 --> 35:57.940
I have real business to attend to later.

36:10.130 --> 36:10.810
Careful.

36:13.620 --> 36:15.530
Sir, please wait for me a moment.

36:18.320 --> 36:19.520
It's fine. I'll do it.

36:33.070 --> 36:34.200
While I'm away,

36:34.200 --> 36:35.720
take good care of yourself.

36:35.720 --> 36:37.920
And don't worry too much about Qian Fei.

36:38.050 --> 36:39.260
I know.

36:40.110 --> 36:42.970
What should I do?
I suddenly can't bear to let you go.

36:43.430 --> 36:44.450
What's wrong with you?

36:44.450 --> 36:46.240
You've never been like this before.

36:46.240 --> 36:48.010
It was different before.

36:48.170 --> 36:50.050
This time it definitely won't be short.

36:50.050 --> 36:51.230
I know you too well.

36:51.680 --> 36:52.650
It's your second time starting a business.

36:52.650 --> 36:55.650
You won't come back
unless you work yourself to death.

36:56.010 --> 36:57.610
I've already figured it out.

36:58.040 --> 36:58.760
Without you,

36:58.760 --> 37:00.280
everything is meaningless.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.880
I'm doing all of this for you.

37:05.180 --> 37:06.010
Okay.

37:06.240 --> 37:08.740
Then work hard and eat well.

37:09.590 --> 37:13.180
Otherwise, don't even think about
coming back and getting married.

37:13.180 --> 37:13.860
Yes.

37:25.090 --> 37:25.880
Alright.

37:26.590 --> 37:27.520
I'm leaving now.

37:27.950 --> 37:29.370
Make sure you eat on time.

37:34.550 --> 37:35.990
Alright. I'm going.

37:37.840 --> 37:38.550
Go now.

37:46.320 --> 37:47.050
Wish me luck!

37:47.740 --> 37:48.790
Good luck!

37:50.470 --> 37:51.330
You'll make it!

38:20.230 --> 38:23.830
[Indoor Skiing Space]

38:27.430 --> 38:28.290
Director Fang.

38:30.640 --> 38:32.240
I have something to tell you.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.250
I'm busy right now.

38:35.390 --> 38:37.150
Just say it.

38:37.950 --> 38:39.680
It won't take much of your time.

38:44.160 --> 38:44.700
Let's go.

39:04.840 --> 39:06.640
What did you want to see me about?

39:08.950 --> 39:09.910
I still remember

39:10.020 --> 39:11.630
the first time I met you.

39:12.490 --> 39:14.290
You really thought highly of me.

39:16.200 --> 39:17.660
What are you trying to say?

39:18.910 --> 39:19.950
All this time,

39:20.390 --> 39:22.390
I've treated you as my idol

39:22.930 --> 39:24.860
and aspired to be someone like you.

39:26.550 --> 39:28.080
But I don't understand why.

39:29.160 --> 39:31.220
Why were you investigated and fired?

39:32.550 --> 39:33.110
No.

39:34.880 --> 39:35.990
What I want to ask is

39:37.780 --> 39:39.980
why you leaked the information to 0.33.

39:42.110 --> 39:44.100
Is it because you once told me

39:44.400 --> 39:46.020
that in your position,

39:47.220 --> 39:50.150
you've already mastered
how to avoid getting fired?

39:59.010 --> 40:01.410
You need to be responsible
for what you say.

40:01.540 --> 40:03.220
You let me take on some work,

40:04.200 --> 40:06.150
not to train or promote me,

40:06.870 --> 40:08.800
but because you'd already planned

40:08.950 --> 40:12.010
to make me the scapegoat
if anything went wrong, right?

40:13.410 --> 40:14.670
I don't have the energy

40:15.870 --> 40:17.800
to groom someone into a scapegoat.

40:20.210 --> 40:22.480
Even if you took the blame,
it was not for me.

40:22.480 --> 40:24.480
It was for the company. Understand?

40:31.090 --> 40:32.240
Do you really think

40:32.270 --> 40:34.670
the company doesn't know you were wronged?

40:36.770 --> 40:39.120
Shouldn't you be thinking about

40:39.270 --> 40:41.580
why you were the one

40:41.890 --> 40:45.230
sacrificed
when they weighed the pros and cons?

40:47.170 --> 40:47.730
Why?

40:50.910 --> 40:51.720
I know.

40:53.270 --> 40:55.950
So even with
all this evidence against you,

40:56.620 --> 40:59.010
the client and the company
will still choose

40:59.010 --> 41:01.270
to keep the one they see as more valuable.

41:01.880 --> 41:02.760
So,

41:03.250 --> 41:04.620
I'm not willing to work with a client

41:04.620 --> 41:05.850
like Shanlifang

41:05.870 --> 41:07.780
that has no sense of right and wrong.

41:07.780 --> 41:10.360
Nor do I want to stay
in a company like He Jing

41:10.550 --> 41:13.210
that can frame its employees
whenever it wants.

41:15.640 --> 41:17.680
So? So you still don't understand.

41:21.310 --> 41:23.640
Do you know
why I liked you so much at first?

41:23.990 --> 41:24.910
Because in you,

41:24.910 --> 41:26.130
I saw a shadow of myself,

41:26.130 --> 41:27.590
the shadow of my past self.

41:29.110 --> 41:30.530
When I first entered the industry,

41:30.530 --> 41:31.890
I was as spirited as you

41:31.920 --> 41:33.380
and had my own principles.

41:34.000 --> 41:35.070
I was reckless.

41:36.800 --> 41:40.000
But after all the glitz and glamour faded,
I realized something.

41:40.000 --> 41:42.460
Even on a sunny day like today,

41:43.430 --> 41:44.550
under our feet,

41:46.310 --> 41:47.970
there are still many shadows.

41:48.800 --> 41:51.530
The right and wrong,
black and white in this world

41:51.810 --> 41:53.170
do not exist independently,

41:53.170 --> 41:54.570
but are interdependent.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.880
Even someone like you,

41:57.900 --> 42:00.200
who is kind-hearted, radiant,

42:00.880 --> 42:02.040
and always doing good deeds,

42:02.040 --> 42:04.430
may not always do the right thing.

42:06.070 --> 42:07.730
You might have harmed others.

42:09.360 --> 42:11.920
So, right and wrong

42:12.990 --> 42:14.220
in this world

42:14.250 --> 42:17.180
are beyond our wisdom to see clearly.

42:17.890 --> 42:18.900
I know

42:19.420 --> 42:20.710
that in this world,

42:21.010 --> 42:23.010
things aren't just black and white.

42:24.510 --> 42:25.640
But I also believe

42:26.240 --> 42:27.700
that in everyone's heart,

42:28.020 --> 42:30.070
they can tell right from wrong.

42:32.880 --> 42:33.800
Director Fang,

42:34.310 --> 42:36.770
I didn't actually come here
to question you,

42:37.320 --> 42:39.660
but to make peace with myself.

42:40.880 --> 42:42.790
The flag, the lighthouse

42:42.820 --> 42:43.950
that once guided me,

42:44.230 --> 42:45.430
no longer exists.

42:45.750 --> 42:46.980
But I'm not afraid.

42:48.470 --> 42:51.270
Because I know
I'm heading in the right direction.

42:52.060 --> 42:53.600
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:53.820 --> 42:55.020
Vice President Liao,

42:55.060 --> 42:56.590
as smart and wise as you are,

42:56.990 --> 42:58.840
you wouldn't focus all your energy

42:58.840 --> 43:01.010
on holding
the underwriter accountable, right?

43:01.010 --> 43:02.200
So what do you mean?

43:02.360 --> 43:04.220
These negative public opinions—

43:04.990 --> 43:06.450
why did they appear?

43:07.550 --> 43:09.280
I think I remember now.

43:09.800 --> 43:11.110
It was you, right?

43:11.230 --> 43:12.510
I don't want to listen to you anymore.

43:12.510 --> 43:13.910
I feel so dizzy right now.

43:14.030 --> 43:15.030
Qian Fei, listen to me.

43:15.030 --> 43:15.430
That day...

43:15.430 --> 43:16.130
Say no more!

43:16.320 --> 43:17.720
Qian Fei, let me explain!

43:19.280 --> 43:20.030
Fei,

43:20.220 --> 43:21.300
I think

43:21.430 --> 43:23.290
you're completely under Li Yifei's spell.
